🚀 The feature, motivation and pitch
Can you please extend math functions like torch::prod to ArrayRef? I would need this feature for computing the total length of multi-dimensional tensors, i.e.
torch::Tensor a(4,5,2);
torch::prod(a.sizes()); // -> 40
Alternatives
Alternatively, this feature could be implemented as
torch::Tensor a(4,5,2);
a.size(-1);
or as a new member functions, e.g.
torch::Tensor a(4,5,2);
a.length();
Additional context
No response

